# Resume Studio — Listing copy & launch notes

Copy-paste starting points for Gumroad and Etsy. Edit names, prices, and the
contact email before publishing. Anything in [brackets] is a placeholder.

===============================================================================
RECOMMENDED SETUP (the short version)
===============================================================================

Sell the SAME product two ways, on two channels:

- GUMROAD (primary) — best fit for selling access + source. Native license
  keys, low fees, easy hosted checkout, supports the "online version" idea
  cleanly. Offer two tiers:
    • Personal — the offline edition (the dist/ folder, zipped). $9–15.
    • Developer / Extended — full source + deploy rights. $29–49.

- ETSY (traffic) — list the offline edition as an instant digital download.
  Etsy's 91M+ buyers search here; treat it as a discovery channel. One simple
  product, ~$8–12. Use it to send buyers toward your Gumroad for the dev tier.

Why not sell "online access" on Etsy: Etsy delivers files, not logins. Since
the app is now a static folder, you don't need login-based access at all — you
just sell the folder. That sidesteps Etsy's whole limitation. Clean and
compliant.

What to upload:
- ZIP of the dist/ folder  → the "offline edition" (for everyday buyers)
- ZIP of the full project (source + README + LICENSE)  → the "developer" tier

===============================================================================
GUMROAD — PRODUCT PAGE
===============================================================================

NAME:
Resume Studio — Editorial ATS Resume Builder (12 Templates, PDF + Word)

SUMMARY (the one-liner under the title):
A clean, offline resume builder with 12 editorial templates. Fill, preview,
export to PDF & Word. No login, no subscription, no AI gimmicks.

DESCRIPTION:
Most resume templates are either a static Word file you fight with, or a
website that locks your export behind a subscription. Resume Studio is neither.

It's a small, fast tool you run in your browser. Type your details once, then
flip through 12 professionally typeset templates — Corporate, Tech, Creative,
Healthcare/Education, Academic, and Trades/Service, two styles each. Watch the
live preview update on a real letter-size page. When it looks right, export a
clean PDF or an editable Word document.

Every template is single-column with standard section names and no text hidden
inside images — so applicant tracking systems (ATS) read it correctly.

What you get:
• 12 editorial templates across 6 professions
• Live preview on an 8.5×11 page
• One-click PDF export (selectable text, ATS-safe)
• One-click Word (.docx) export you can keep editing
• Clay/Sage color options on the Creative templates
• Runs fully in your browser — nothing is uploaded, nothing is tracked

No account. No monthly fee. No watermark.

TIERS:
• Personal ($12) — the ready-to-run app. Unzip, open index.html, done.
• Developer ($39) — full source code (React + Vite), deploy rights, README,
  and a commercial license to host it on your own site.

Note: clicking export loads the PDF/Word engine from the web the first time,
so the export buttons need internet on first use.

