ETSY — LISTING
===============================================================================

TITLE (front-load keywords, ~140 chars):
ATS Resume Builder | 12 Editorial Resume Templates | Instant Download | PDF + Word Export | Modern Minimalist CV Maker | No Subscription

DESCRIPTION:
Build a polished, ATS-friendly resume in minutes — no design skills, no
monthly fee, no login.

This is a downloadable resume builder you open right in your web browser. Enter
your details once and switch instantly between 12 typeset templates across 6
career fields. Export a clean PDF or an editable Word file when you're happy.

★ WHAT'S INCLUDED
• A ready-to-use resume builder (open in any browser)
• 12 templates: Corporate, Tech, Creative, Healthcare/Education, Academic,
  Trades & Service — 2 styles each
• PDF export with real, selectable text (ATS-safe)
• Word (.docx) export you can keep editing
• Live preview as you type

★ WHY IT'S DIFFERENT
• Single-column, standard sections, no text-in-images → reads correctly in
  applicant tracking systems
• No subscription, no watermark, no account
• Nothing you type is uploaded or stored

★ HOW IT WORKS
1. Download & unzip
2. Open index.html in your browser
3. Fill in your info, pick a template
4. Download your PDF or Word file

★ NOTE
The export buttons need an internet connection the first time you use them.
This is a digital product — no physical item is shipped. Due to the nature of
instant downloads, all sales are final.

Want the source code / the right to host it on your own website? Message me for
the developer edition.

TAGS (fill all 13):
resume template, ats resume, cv template, resume builder, modern resume,
minimalist resume, resume pdf, word resume, professional cv, editable resume,
job application, resume maker, instant download

PRICE: $9.50  (test $8–12; bundle more if you raise it)

CATEGORY: choose a digital/templates category
DIGITAL FILE: upload the zipped offline edition; set as instant download
MOCKUP IMAGES: screenshot 3–4 of the rendered templates (the actual resume
output, NOT the code). Show them as resumes on a page. Add one image listing
the 6 categories. A plain code screenshot will not sell.

===============================================================================
PRICING LOGIC
===============================================================================
You have zero per-sale cost now (no API). So price on perceived value:
- Look at the top 5 listings for "ats resume template". Match or slightly
  undercut for volume, or price higher with more included (extra templates,
  a cover-letter template, a quick-start PDF guide) for premium positioning.
- The developer tier is where the margin is — technical buyers expect to pay
  more for source + deploy rights, and it costs you nothing to deliver.

